  "question": {
    "text": "<p>When light of wavelength <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>248</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math> falls on a metal of threshold energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>eV</mi></math>, the de-Broglie wavelength of emitted electrons is ________&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mover></math>.&nbsp;(Round off to the Nearest Integer).</p><p>[Use :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>73</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>63</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Js</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ms</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>eV</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p>"
  },
